OL,3,GNEWSAProbe after 'refuse worker's
OL,4,ASnapchat requests'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA refuse worker is being investigated
OL,7,Fover a potential data breach after
OL,8,Fallegedly using a young woman's
OL,9,Fpersonal details to contact her
OL,10,Frepeatedly on social media.
OL,12,FAccording to her father, the unnamed
OL,13,Fwoman was left "frightened" when a
OL,14,Fworker at Stanton St Quintin Household
OL,15,FRecycling Centre, near Chippenham,
OL,16,Ftried to add her on Snapchat and
OL,17,FInstagram over a period of nine days in
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
