OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "You expect there to be a
OL,7,Flevel of privacy and anyone who takes a
OL,8,Ffancy to someone can't just access
OL,9,Ftheir information and contact them `
OL,10,Fit's totally outrageous."
OL,12,FA Wiltshire Council spokesperson said
OL,13,Fit had referred the potential breach to
OL,14,Fthe Information Commissioner's Office
OL,15,F(ICO) to consider.
